  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Count a sequence",
   "texto": [
    "To order facts you can use **først** («first», already known), **deretter** («after») and **til slutt** («last»). If one of these markers goes to the beginning, the conjugated verb takes second place: **Deretter laget hun en plan**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "More regular past",
   "texto": [
    "There are frequent verbs with past in **-et** and **-te**: starte → startt, lage → laget, diskutere → diskuterte. The past remains the same with «I», «You» and «her.»."
   ]
  },
